1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.gavledraget.se/A2/Kyrka_Kyrkfolk_Del_V.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT * Birth:	Circa 1657 - Turku, Finland
2 CONT * Death:	May 1 1725 - Gävle, Gävleborg, Sweden
2 CONT * Parents:	Henrik Henriksson Schaefer, Elin Pettersdotter Schaefer (born Thorwöst)
2 CONT * Siblings:	Elin Henriksdotter Hasselqvist (born Schaefer), Henrik Henriksson Heerdhielm (Schäfer), Margaretha Henriksdotter Thauvonius (born Schaefer), Peter Henriksson Schäfer, Carl Henriksson Schäfer, Magdalena Henriksdotter Ra
2 CONC umannus (born Schaefer), Johan Jacob Ehrensvärd (Schäffer)
2 CONT * Children:	Anna Margareta Johansdotter Sacklinius (born Pihlman (Schaeffer)), Henrik Johansson Schaefer, Gevert Johansson Schaefer
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Chaplain of the Swedish congregation in Turku 1682; King Charles XI's court preacher 1684–; Pastor of Gävle 1690–; rovasti 1690; forest Finnish visitor in Gästrikland and Hälsingland. Defender of the Finnish language. The forest F
2 CONC inns had lived in Sweden for 70 years without organized ecclesiastical pastoral care. The king had issued a poster in 1682 that the Finns had to either learn Swedish or move back to Finland. Defended the right of Finns to speak Fi
2 CONC nnish in Sweden. Schaefer happened to hear the peasants speak Finnish to each other at Gävle Market Square and realized that there had to be a lot of people among the forest Finns in Gästrikland and Hälsingland who were Rama finna
2 CONC r (pure Finns) and did not understand Swedish. This attention made him worried about the pastoral care of the forest Finns and that these were completely beyond the ecclesiastical control of orthodoxy. There had been a great dispu
2 CONC te between the forest Finns of Hälsingland and Gästrikland in the 1680s. In Schaefer's opinion, the order to speak Swedish had no positive effect. It was appalling that forest Finns had been able to live in Sweden for 70 years wit
2 CONC hout organized ecclesiastical pastoral care. https://kansallisbiografia.fi/kansallisbiograf…/henkilöo/5628 Pastor of Gävle, forest Finnish visitor of forest Finns.
