1 NAME Henrik Abraham /Hasselhuhn/
2 GIVN Henrik Abraham
2 SURN Hasselhuhn
2 _MARNM Hasselhuhn
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 21 NOV 1793
2 ADDR
