2 CONT * http://www.vc.id.au/tb/bgcolonistsA.html 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://runeberg.org/strokirk/2/0249.html
2 CONT
2 CONT The large extended Allicock family from Upper Demerara is traced to the five original siblings’ settlers, John, Thomas, Robert- Frederick and their two sisters Sarah and Susanna Allicock. Of the five, John Allicock did not appear 
2 CONC to have any descendants.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Grandfather came from Hanover. He came to the Colony with the English Soldiers. He left Germany and went to England and enlisted. The Regiment was coming to B.G. '''He married Elizabeth Allicock . Her Father was an American, but 
2 CONC he is of Scottish descent. "''' http://boards.ancestry.com/localities.southam.guyana.general/232.1/mb.ashx
