1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Utvandrad till Nord Amerika 18/4 1871
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Married 1) John Hedman in Sweden. Together they were parents of Eric G. Hedman, Olive Hedman, and Gladys Hedman.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 2) Anders Gustaf Peterson. Together they were parents of Emma Christina (Peterson) Berg, Joseph Peterson Hedman (who took the Hedman name "for business reasons"), Ellen Augusta Josephine Peterson, and Oscar Benjamin Peters
2 CONC on.
2 CONT
2 CONT Traveled to China to be with Ellen, who was a missionary there with the Women's American Baptist Foreign Missionary Society.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/125273910/martha-peterson
2 CONT
