1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT Märta Ingeborg Hedman was born on October 4, 1865, in Undersåker, Jämtland, Sweden, and died on June 29, 1896, in Quincy, Norfolk, Massachusetts, USA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Here are some key details about Märta Ingeborg Hedman based on the retrieved documents:
2 CONT
2 CONT * Birth: October 4, 1865, in Undersåker, Jämtland, Sweden.
2 CONT * Death: June 29, 1896, in Quincy, Norfolk, Massachusetts, USA.
2 CONT * Parents: Johan Ersson Hedman and Martha Olsdotter.
2 CONT * Marriage: She married Nils August Petersson on June 30, 1887, in New Sweden, Aroostook, Maine, USA.
2 CONT * Children: She had one child, William Augustine Weeden, born on July 18, 1900, in Quincy, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sources:
2 CONT
2 CONT * [Entry for Ingeborg Hedman Weeden, "Massachusetts, Town Clerk, Vital and Town Records, 1626-2001"] - (https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:FH8G-1RD)
2 CONT * Summary: This document provides details about Ingeborg Hedman Weeden's birth, death, and parents.
2 CONT * Excerpt: Ingeborg Hedman Weeden, Female, birthDate: '1866', deathDate: 29 June 1896, deathPlace: Quincy, Norfolk, Massachusetts, United States.
2 CONT * [Inge B. Hedman in entry for August N. Weiden, "Maine, Marriages, 1771-1907"] - (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:F4F2-ZLC)
2 CONT * Summary: This document records the marriage of Inge B. Hedman to August N. Weiden.
2 CONT * [Ingie Hedman, "Massachusetts, Town Clerk, Vital and Town Records, 1626-2001"] - (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:F45M-DM3)
2 CONT * Summary: This document provides details about her son, William Augustine Weeden.
2 CONT * [Ingie Hedman, "Massachusetts, State Vital Records, 1638-1927"] - (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:FX4M-RPK)
2 CONT * Summary: This document confirms the birth of William Augustine Weeden.
2 CONT * https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/4:1:L7WN-BPL
2 CONT * Find a Grave, database and images (https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/43858913/ingodina_m-weeden: accessed July 16, 2025), memorial page for Ingodina M “Inga” Hedman Weeden (4 Oct 1865–29 Jun 1896), Find a Grave Memorial ID 438
2 CONC 58913, citing Mount Wollaston Cemetery, Quincy, Norfolk County, Massachusetts, USA; Maintained by Sarah D (contributor 47020212).
